sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sekvencijalni dijagram - Prijava i autorizacija (JWT)

    actor Korisnik
    participant LoginDialog as Angular<br/>LoginDialog
    participant AuthService
    participant AppUser
    participant AuthInterceptor
    participant DjangoAPI as Django API
    participant MariaDB

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over LoginDialog,DjangoAPI: Prijava

        Korisnik->>LoginDialog: Unosi username i password
        activate LoginDialog
        LoginDialog->>AuthService: login(username, password)
        activate AuthService
        AuthService->>DjangoAPI: POST /api/auth/login/<br/>[username, password]
        activate DjangoAPI
        DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: SELECT * FROM user<br/>WHERE username = ?
        activate MariaDB
        MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: user record
        deactivate MariaDB
        DjangoAPI->>DjangoAPI: Verifikuje password hash
        DjangoAPI->>DjangoAPI: Generiše JWT par<br/>(access: 1h, refresh: 3d)
        DjangoAPI-->>AuthService: 200 OK {access, refresh}
        deactivate DjangoAPI

        AuthService->>AuthService: decodeJWTAccessToken(access)
        AuthService->>DjangoAPI: GET /api/auth/user/{user_id}/
        activate DjangoAPI
        DjangoAPI->>MariaDB: SELECT * FROM user JOIN company
        activate MariaDB
        MariaDB-->>DjangoAPI: user + company data
        deactivate MariaDB
        DjangoAPI-->>AuthService: 200 OK (user data)
        deactivate DjangoAPI

        AuthService->>AuthService: user = mapToUser(response)
        AuthService->>AppUser: tokens = {access, refresh}
        activate AppUser
        AuthService->>AppUser: tokenExpiration = decoded.exp
        AuthService->>AppUser: setLoggedIn(true)
        deactivate AppUser
        AuthService->>AuthService: sessionStorage.setItem('tokens')
        AuthService->>AuthService: sessionStorage.setItem('user')
        AuthService-->>LoginDialog: true
        deactivate AuthService

        LoginDialog->>LoginDialog: Zatvara dijalog
        LoginDialog->>LoginDialog: Preusmeravanje na osnovu uloge:<br/>- Admin -> /admin/countryManagement<br/>- Firma -> /dealership/dashboard<br/>- Korisnik -> /home
        deactivate LoginDialog
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over AuthInterceptor,DjangoAPI: Automatsko osvežavanje tokena

        Korisnik->>LoginDialog: Akcija koja zahteva API poziv
        activate LoginDialog
        LoginDialog->>AuthInterceptor: HTTP zahtev
        deactivate LoginDialog
        activate AuthInterceptor
        AuthInterceptor->>AuthInterceptor: Proverava da li je<br/>access token istekao

        alt Token istekao
            AuthInterceptor->>DjangoAPI: POST /api/token/refresh/<br/>{refresh: refreshToken}
            activate DjangoAPI
            DjangoAPI-->>AuthInterceptor: 200 OK {access, refresh}
            deactivate DjangoAPI
            AuthInterceptor->>AuthInterceptor: Ažurira tokens i expiration
            AuthInterceptor->>AuthInterceptor: Klonira zahtev sa novim tokenom
        end

        AuthInterceptor->>AuthInterceptor: Dodaje Authorization header<br/>Bearer {accessToken}
        AuthInterceptor->>AuthInterceptor: Dodaje trailing slash na URL
        AuthInterceptor->>DjangoAPI: Prosleđuje zahtev
        activate DjangoAPI
        DjangoAPI-->>AuthInterceptor: HTTP Odgovor (Podaci)
        deactivate DjangoAPI
        AuthInterceptor-->>Korisnik: Vraća podatke na UI
        deactivate AuthInterceptor
    end